
# Sinfin_Viewer_stable.py — updated to add ROI classification & color-coding by metrics
# Rich 5D (T,Z,Y,X) hypervolume viewer with a rerunnable pipeline and reporting.
# NOTE: This build adds a Classification UI that lets you choose a metric (e.g., lifetime, max_area,
# amp_range, first_time, displacement length 2D, duty_cycle, n_active_runs, site_label), select a
# method (Quantiles K, single Threshold, or By Site), and automatically color‑code:
#  • The ROI points layer (per-ROI colors)
#  • The "ROIs (all @ t)" labels overlay (optionally) so voxels show class colors at current frame.
#
# Default classification is lifetime quantiles (K=3). Toggles and settings are in the right‑hand panel.
#
